  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "人间的正义是在那里呢？",
      "output_sha256": "2a9e4782cd0161bd6f01bc0813b2dbbe4cb175a18fbcbe74c485dfeafc3ffcd0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a9e4782cd0161bd6f01bc0813b2dbbe4cb175a18fbcbe74c485dfeafc3ffcd0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "正义是在我们的心里！",
      "output_sha256": "110792b901c35c239c99f551eea86b34366fcbe381481e140e0ddf9fd7d586b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "110792b901c35c239c99f551eea86b34366fcbe381481e140e0ddf9fd7d586b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "透过明哲的教训和生活的领悟，我们并不是积累了许多正义吗？",
      "output_sha256": "c4f883f1ae412ec3078e5c1476c78e2a048265c5545a8f4c65ba1d2d74275bfd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.505256,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d4e3ede130e316f5e6e49b3f681aa35f6968312a0615135cec28761fae7cb081"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c4f883f1ae412ec3078e5c1476c78e2a048265c5545a8f4c65ba1d2d74275bfd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，这些正义若仅仅被搁置在心中而无人使用，那真是一种可惜。",
      "output_sha256": "9bce33fd3290b98f7752d35518f2a4fa1853b1ec478cf23b357043a3e2991043",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.329868,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e27b6cf1841c5a5fa209113559f6a3f767ab1eb7c4adeceb2450f330dcb17230"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9bce33fd3290b98f7752d35518f2a4fa1853b1ec478cf23b357043a3e2991043",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "两石白米堆在屋里，总要吃它干净，两箱衣服堆在屋里，总要轮流穿换，一大堆正义却扔在一旁，满不理会，我们真大方，真舍得！",
      "output_sha256": "702372906c809269b7878968af920087947d90692f069d2bfb5eab8b6e8ab830",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "702372906c809269b7878968af920087947d90692f069d2bfb5eab8b6e8ab830",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这些正义似乎真是贱，甚至比起一尖米粒或一颗扣子都显得微不足道。",
      "output_sha256": "80ab72ad0c3aa8e942067dbcf6609332f4d96c0729dc97b65ca1aea270eba7c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.30282,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7e3fc8fa50d773253938b43ea71061cdb7ecf29bd1e70ee7cc1fec5dceeca6c2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "80ab72ad0c3aa8e942067dbcf6609332f4d96c0729dc97b65ca1aea270eba7c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若干放弃使用倒也罢了，偏偏大家却又装出一副急切的模样，慌张地四处寻找。",
      "output_sha256": "83e70a6d4c8e26a23c1214042a6d8b84d86603ed65e31e300bdace1f68e9a2d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.469865,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "037a7cd995dc735a9fed6c986844239cde3a7ebb3e78405628354b8663b6cfe1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "83e70a6d4c8e26a23c1214042a6d8b84d86603ed65e31e300bdace1f68e9a2d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这个葫芦里卖的什么药？",
      "output_sha256": "a7ade559ced8bd83fefaa524ffc30051b5253d701613187b06212b643b21a8a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "a7ade559ced8bd83fefaa524ffc30051b5253d701613187b06212b643b21a8a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的聪明的同伴呀，我真想不通了！",
      "output_sha256": "b435dcc429f40846fa8a45965af63039f2aac814b9b5be09b257026df5270dc8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "b435dcc429f40846fa8a45965af63039f2aac814b9b5be09b257026df5270dc8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不曾见过正义的面，只见过它的弯曲的影儿在“自我”的唇边，在“威权”的面前，在“他人”的背后。",
      "output_sha256": "0d1c7c587ce9106599e4323b15b176da79a16eaddf6f953084c410f8ac167fcd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d1c7c587ce9106599e4323b15b176da79a16eaddf6f953084c410f8ac167fcd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "正义可以做幌子，一个漂亮的幌子，所以谁都愿意念着它的名字。",
      "output_sha256": "c4f53a4aa2fdfd2689202b42c6fa52dae031ca23ecfcd62929a5cf714ba9c3e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "c4f53a4aa2fdfd2689202b42c6fa52dae031ca23ecfcd62929a5cf714ba9c3e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“我是个正人君子，我要做正经事”，每个人都在向同伴隐晦地自我吹嘘。",
      "output_sha256": "7b396c765e6adbdd8ef20a7175202225b0827b5f3bb832a6de949947427452d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.525108,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a0ef3e8e6b95ac4dc86a28cd52ce5fc8d45524baf25a74e8c575e64a0007e778"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7b396c765e6adbdd8ef20a7175202225b0827b5f3bb832a6de949947427452d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是除了用以“自诩”之外，正义对于他还有什么作用呢？",
      "output_sha256": "a9a5ffbcba3e11fcadef0fefff17d33ea549cd79c6b8f4fe36fec5790eb96eba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9a5ffbcba3e11fcadef0fefff17d33ea549cd79c6b8f4fe36fec5790eb96eba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他独自一个时，在生人中间时，早忘了它的名字，而去创造“自己的正义”了！",
      "output_sha256": "a183839fdfbcb42d20797119ce7fa99e4937f226ce64e8c1078ccd5321e92573",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "a183839fdfbcb42d20797119ce7fa99e4937f226ce64e8c1078ccd5321e92573",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他所给予正义的，只是让它的影儿在他的唇边闪烁一番而已。",
      "output_sha256": "27031745c7a962fb8504a2051183d3766bf82c112d6ac9e42550c01736084f7b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "27031745c7a962fb8504a2051183d3766bf82c112d6ac9e42550c01736084f7b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，这总比那些借着正义的名义行恶的人要好。",
      "output_sha256": "d07103d54758622df0db4768e8d57be3b5ba0dd618a9684b8ef5ccfda62f8dfa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.391007,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d0f822049685f16be88183b18ddbaa3d6fd4dd157a36b2ea0a6c5491aac1f9cc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d07103d54758622df0db4768e8d57be3b5ba0dd618a9684b8ef5ccfda62f8dfa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可怕的正是这种假名行恶的人。",
      "output_sha256": "1f218eeb4fb24a76ed7b122f09128e39b6bf3662a96722c4efdfc08f807c8d93",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "1f218eeb4fb24a76ed7b122f09128e39b6bf3662a96722c4efdfc08f807c8d93",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们口中吟唱着正义的名字，手中却紧握着罪恶；这些罪恶被他们华丽地包装成正义的礼物送给社会。",
      "output_sha256": "6614c665c1cdb34f649acce6c58464a11f7b84ccee85a8721cad017cfef690f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.510681,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3637aef11f3cc0266b19055899cbdf1c7bdeec76c98a8e39c18764e4f9b66a69"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6614c665c1cdb34f649acce6c58464a11f7b84ccee85a8721cad017cfef690f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "社会凭着他所唱的名字和所粘的签条，欣然受了这份礼；就是明知道是罪恶，也还是欣然受了这份礼！",
      "output_sha256": "3ec501846f62e1a92dfe5ff6adc24bf87a4f504f794b08bd478849351a62d508",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ec501846f62e1a92dfe5ff6adc24bf87a4f504f794b08bd478849351a62d508",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "易卜生“社会栋梁”一出戏，就是这种情形。",
      "output_sha256": "f0928087779ccca2a90df4d58ff22cd70a8fc9c521de89d660b1e45a3478142b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0928087779ccca2a90df4d58ff22cd70a8fc9c521de89d660b1e45a3478142b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这种人的唇边，虽更频繁的闪烁着正义的弯曲的影儿，但是深藏在他们心底的正义，只怕早已霉了，烂了，且将毁灭了。",
      "output_sha256": "34316054fb825f4498d5cd5909f67303922367c1ffd1011a7c5c3887d2a31229",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "34316054fb825f4498d5cd5909f67303922367c1ffd1011a7c5c3887d2a31229",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在这些人里，我见不着正义！",
      "output_sha256": "516bbb3f7319c5741594284df6455106a234c1150eefa49d2dab87fa28970c5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "516bbb3f7319c5741594284df6455106a234c1150eefa49d2dab87fa28970c5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在亲子、师徒、军官与士兵、上司与下属之间，似乎有正义可见，但实际上并非如此。",
      "output_sha256": "a2da81b558d4065856536bc2b89db96a55b649815e28d2e74ff967d40da0fce2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.551307,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b3ad063b12fdc057413d1bada0bccec2811418dad44729e7e7f275c39954ad99"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a2da81b558d4065856536bc2b89db96a55b649815e28d2e74ff967d40da0fce2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "卑幼大抵顺从他们长上的，长上要施行正义于他们，他们诚然是不“能”违抗的甚至“父教子死，子不得不死”一类话也说出来了。",
      "output_sha256": "084338aa935086574039419afdde1697a7a22a628dec2e29fbc85afd26d3c5fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "084338aa935086574039419afdde1697a7a22a628dec2e29fbc85afd26d3c5fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们察觉到长者身后的权威与可见的奖惩，怎敢违抗呢？",
      "output_sha256": "b82ec8d404786b22ed46877bca769926c9325e4656114b2518d0096b2d726d7a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.375382,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c5bdebe696c84931e369731ad6e27b6c382ff859980977896bc9c71880e60e4f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b82ec8d404786b22ed46877bca769926c9325e4656114b2518d0096b2d726d7a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "长上们凭着威权的名字施行正义，他们怎敢不遵呢？",
      "output_sha256": "b1fdd2972f0e9e7d7ad474b7488ca5d7db56a49b147078800048bcd494fc8a6a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1fdd2972f0e9e7d7ad474b7488ca5d7db56a49b147078800048bcd494fc8a6a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是你私下问他们，“信么？",
      "output_sha256": "0deaffb2648bf37c41ce80c92632c097c851701312f36a7a080f9414adb91a2b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "0deaffb2648bf37c41ce80c92632c097c851701312f36a7a080f9414adb91a2b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "服么？”",
      "output_sha256": "9070b67f2af1bef2ce3e8a5b534c898ba32c35e4aa11c4d08fdfdc621eeafb66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "9070b67f2af1bef2ce3e8a5b534c898ba32c35e4aa11c4d08fdfdc621eeafb66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他们必然会摇头，甚至愤然举拳。",
      "output_sha256": "f6bd71b25dc05756ddc448a2462df07b5096f143f769af2daaa095780e92a8d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.423182,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8157fc8f789e67d3591ecc8b29475aa6dbaec9c2154eec4f5af985755525a1d3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f6bd71b25dc05756ddc448a2462df07b5096f143f769af2daaa095780e92a8d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这正是因为长上们不凭着正义的名字而施行正义的缘故了。",
      "output_sha256": "417649710a10de58c7851958fb7fd55072a7e989a4b93a569ea46d19ded022c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "417649710a10de58c7851958fb7fd55072a7e989a4b93a569ea46d19ded022c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这种正义只能由长上行于卑幼，卑幼是不能行于长上的，所以是偏颇的；这种正义只能施于卑幼，而不能施于他人，所以是破碎的；这种正义受着威权的鼓弄，有时不免要扩大到它的应有的轮廓之外，那时它又是肥大的。",
      "output_sha256": "9bae77eb1988882b633b2d78b6c05adc4988085766a786e6e51c583a12e1607f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "9bae77eb1988882b633b2d78b6c05adc4988085766a786e6e51c583a12e1607f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这些仍旧只是正义的弯曲的影儿。",
      "output_sha256": "bdf2e007bb3623aaeb800e27902ba703fa4e4a61dfa29154e0b96825db13ab88",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "bdf2e007bb3623aaeb800e27902ba703fa4e4a61dfa29154e0b96825db13ab88",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不凭着正义的名字而施行正义，我在这等人里，仍旧见不着它！",
      "output_sha256": "ad4ceba3cc6a61a5c89fe25be0223f8143b8fc6a2d8ccb97a9d02f54a461530a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "ad4ceba3cc6a61a5c89fe25be0223f8143b8fc6a2d8ccb97a9d02f54a461530a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在没有威权的地方，正义的影儿更弯曲了。",
      "output_sha256": "4864eccec7ff14448974002c6cbc647a94a37b3affa3708df27c583594227faa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "4864eccec7ff14448974002c6cbc647a94a37b3affa3708df27c583594227faa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "面对权位与金钱，正义的痕迹变得微乎其微。",
      "output_sha256": "e97262e87b855f0f3ecc6b77e6ce60597d4150a4d712cd58c9675ba37bfc7f11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.447778,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4b04d53914a5723228b7ebef3a53ca2df713d50b6b37ec753ba6ae6a9dab2f7a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e97262e87b855f0f3ecc6b77e6ce60597d4150a4d712cd58c9675ba37bfc7f11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你瞧现在一班大人先生见了所谓督军等人的劲儿！",
      "output_sha256": "f0cd2142d5d751d68a2cdaae6b2e19bbafaa9787270a4b2017b0735bf227ec21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0cd2142d5d751d68a2cdaae6b2e19bbafaa9787270a4b2017b0735bf227ec21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们未必愿意如此的，但是一当了面，估量着对手的名位，就不免心里一软，自然要给他一些面子于是不知不觉的就敷衍起来了。",
      "output_sha256": "a1cf6e514542f562930a1d930ff0f05915f8b965baf4d49e23f61771dc8ca8f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "a1cf6e514542f562930a1d930ff0f05915f8b965baf4d49e23f61771dc8ca8f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至于平常的人，偶然见了所谓名流，也不免要吃一惊，那时就是心里有一百二十个不以为然，也只好姑且放下，另做出一番“足恭”的样子，以表倾慕之诚。",
      "output_sha256": "ed575c49abdccefa0583f885049368d663b9920c2c1e8b6cd9529a0407996553",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "ed575c49abdccefa0583f885049368d663b9920c2c1e8b6cd9529a0407996553",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，这些达官显贵，几乎成了正义的化外之民，他们所做的都符合正义，甚至他们所做的就是正义！",
      "output_sha256": "d40b6655c2071f4124a6292c7c2d0e353674d831cb30d79dc857168b500e0483",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.616661,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "40075ff51b23168e5dad806562719863b40cf5b5acbbe72d6664c42badf0b20e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d40b6655c2071f4124a6292c7c2d0e353674d831cb30d79dc857168b500e0483",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在他们心中，正义与否已无关紧要。",
      "output_sha256": "ad05eeba87806deafdd1a5d9d443e32a971000c8b92aeeb9e517078fc3eb24cd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.519048,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "36db81159f9ce39fbdc51dde2e94c015dbc5db76e69b2b118bc265b733e46bfd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ad05eeba87806deafdd1a5d9d443e32a971000c8b92aeeb9e517078fc3eb24cd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "呀！",
      "output_sha256": "971e447a960a0ee0a628076c22f27d5ee86ce266d1598843dbba7f284c5cf7ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "971e447a960a0ee0a628076c22f27d5ee86ce266d1598843dbba7f284c5cf7ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如此一来，正义难道不是已经沦亡了吗？",
      "output_sha256": "3d59228111beae952e072963b52fe6b741e847c6c04145a94d98aa2fe876a443",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.504167,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ce0117e8c8e4003b06a1852883a88ef22e986754ba0c231f4f1e5812a6b91bf2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3d59228111beae952e072963b52fe6b741e847c6c04145a94d98aa2fe876a443",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "却又不然。",
      "output_sha256": "8867815ea19d66bbe00ed0d12ed47387d7a553c2502a0df686332a3ee98f7d94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "8867815ea19d66bbe00ed0d12ed47387d7a553c2502a0df686332a3ee98f7d94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "须知我只说“面前”是无正义的，“背后”的正义却幸而还保留着。",
      "output_sha256": "9e886c1e4510f3d6fdbcd920696fc68ac6216be7d3c1e148ed467b57e4bb0859",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "9e886c1e4510f3d6fdbcd920696fc68ac6216be7d3c1e148ed467b57e4bb0859",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "社会的维持，大部分或者就靠着这背后的正义罢。",
      "output_sha256": "926382fd59d5863fda902e0d181ad704dc5290cb71905f5ea2ae8c1eded6fc9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "926382fd59d5863fda902e0d181ad704dc5290cb71905f5ea2ae8c1eded6fc9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，背后的正义力量有限，因为隔着一层，便变得薄弱。",
      "output_sha256": "2fd249f966178df640f1a02a7b6413380d40bd59bcaa95a09db0944db8930590",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.53109,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6668854ec1b992a4bb947dfea2dbaffe1618e156547fe52ac183ed06c4354504"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2fd249f966178df640f1a02a7b6413380d40bd59bcaa95a09db0944db8930590",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一个富有而无仁的人，虽然背后难免遭人指责，面前却只有恭敬。",
      "output_sha256": "9e252b8d64861e8900b23b6082ec6fd36d97e40db955de0a25fdb894c14f265b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.605753,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aa211c913e77e7c09cdc447431b3b6826786df5181463bee0256b3c76d3a24c5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9e252b8d64861e8900b23b6082ec6fd36d97e40db955de0a25fdb894c14f265b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一个华服翩翩的人，若犯了法律，警察也会对他另眼相看。",
      "output_sha256": "17d95053a9c565e8fb0fdbfbe4bef8e285e70faafc1b8fadda80e85601a58502",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.606714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a13387f0090587b6ff5717fc0eb1601f9beb1e7c101514bcde393e16ef7538a8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "17d95053a9c565e8fb0fdbfbe4bef8e285e70faafc1b8fadda80e85601a58502",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这就是我们的正义了！",
      "output_sha256": "961c142fba31be60f47101b31ac4ce155756d8339db8ee1ddde6a8b4f0ca246f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "961c142fba31be60f47101b31ac4ce155756d8339db8ee1ddde6a8b4f0ca246f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们的正义中，百分之九十九都隐藏在背后，而在亲密的人群中，有时甚至连这背后的正义也不复存在！",
      "output_sha256": "7456adc482380435db11979137f3790a572daa440e1215f124486ca26435f9e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.627797,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f218c820896e651d6a33b60284f8673fcb65aaa2c6f323d9b6ffc84e2aa12843"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7456adc482380435db11979137f3790a572daa440e1215f124486ca26435f9e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因为关系过于亲近，一切都可以被原谅，任何事都可以被忽略，正义也因此任其扭曲。",
      "output_sha256": "320bd9b10d3322aa8a4e6e7bd8580252b47c4db842770fb99996b9f5c3b4b478",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.439706,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eb29aa39a283da6df7c56e086dc94f63014be6f1eb5423ea0046a9afc659364c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "320bd9b10d3322aa8a4e6e7bd8580252b47c4db842770fb99996b9f5c3b4b478",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "背后的正义只有存生疏的人们间。",
      "output_sha256": "93445f2a2d461a1669da4631d52caec25e54f6605c51d1e884ec26a9d1f2c736",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "93445f2a2d461a1669da4631d52caec25e54f6605c51d1e884ec26a9d1f2c736",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "生疏的人们间，没有什么密切的关系，自然可以用上正义这个幌子。",
      "output_sha256": "fc6243725aeba9a9c0f8ea3929277f3cf56e9e02b7a4e2337a0a3b51658735c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc6243725aeba9a9c0f8ea3929277f3cf56e9e02b7a4e2337a0a3b51658735c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "至于一定要到背后才叫出正义来，那全是为了情面的缘故。",
      "output_sha256": "2da851740642d966648f13a13f58cee395ea7330d055a4e1c2ddd4e743219ea0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "2da851740642d966648f13a13f58cee395ea7330d055a4e1c2ddd4e743219ea0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "情面的根柢大概也是一种同情，一种廉价的同情。",
      "output_sha256": "deef6705137f5ba428b82209f51bfe1ffa6cda3477d9e42b0be03fcb19b93782",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "deef6705137f5ba428b82209f51bfe1ffa6cda3477d9e42b0be03fcb19b93782",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在的人们只喜欢廉价的东西，在正义与情面两者中，就尽先取了情面，而将正义放在背后。",
      "output_sha256": "853a873a899b344a7278a6d136887ab09d76ee4d49c270030bee9b17996e3ca6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "853a873a899b344a7278a6d136887ab09d76ee4d49c270030bee9b17996e3ca6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在极为亲近的人群中，情面的优先权达到了极致，正义几乎变为零，甚至在背后也消失。",
      "output_sha256": "2490a679471776e95c8dcf791c05559f654769753e43837fda984faa1e93b2ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.594327,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "50fb6c04c8465ffcdb350ad18491c865a7ccda876db91caa9fc59533a24b8813"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2490a679471776e95c8dcf791c05559f654769753e43837fda984faa1e93b2ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "虽然背后的正义仍有一定的力量，但与面前的正义相比，却大相径庭，启发与警惕的功能犹如稀薄的牛乳，仍旧只能算作一个扭曲的影子。",
      "output_sha256": "97dcc383d261febfac2627d8bcec894f3a43ca0f7c9ed12ebd9157abd79fa763",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.543525,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "36033c0a0e31b3f1e6b491677b67fb6ce2b2c95e1a494497b6d8263ac362d85a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "97dcc383d261febfac2627d8bcec894f3a43ca0f7c9ed12ebd9157abd79fa763",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在这样的环境中，我更无法找到正义的存在！",
      "output_sha256": "706bc33df3011eefd5d83817073d98a8c780b3d76015feaaa102b277c282d4e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": 0.374333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d2ac285384a8ad536bf55ad669f362af84c45689c8e97b6fe1d25662dd09b896"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "706bc33df3011eefd5d83817073d98a8c780b3d76015feaaa102b277c282d4e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "人间的正义究竟身处何方？",
      "output_sha256": "88353fb17d6a36785b205c75d7cd4d225af6e1930c35b4601f2aaa72c0513841",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": 0.602246,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d829dd3404de1eeabb3af3a7db3c3dc58a67332702d0fcdffc8363e128b896b8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
