      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "为何不将其取出呢？",
      "output_sha256": "37d29434de6047e512af4c237cdf145f9733f2801e689e77e4bbe3df59641d0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": 0.529327,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fd5108cea3be480e8b012bdd417c7f83e3b7787b8921014e9700e141ee9b7e6e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_ai_sha256": "37d29434de6047e512af4c237cdf145f9733f2801e689e77e4bbe3df59641d0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "它没有优先权！",
      "output_sha256": "3b40d04c46908b21510619610ed2040af429440cf54432cc8c0dba6b836f85be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "3b40d04c46908b21510619610ed2040af429440cf54432cc8c0dba6b836f85be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在我们心里，第一个尖儿是自私，其馀就是威权，势力，亲疏，情面等等；等到这些角色一一演毕，才轮得到我们可怜的正义。",
      "output_sha256": "a893aa4e3aaa126b8a7b36eaabbdba13232987e99ffe1c2f838f8cb425794d39",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "a893aa4e3aaa126b8a7b36eaabbdba13232987e99ffe1c2f838f8cb425794d39",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你想，时候已经晚了，它还有出台的机会么？",
      "output_sha256": "7ec75e547ead91722931d74ee25d6c1cf8a3c001bd8a9e5b584e2a67c02c03a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "7ec75e547ead91722931d74ee25d6c1cf8a3c001bd8a9e5b584e2a67c02c03a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "没有！",
      "output_sha256": "35f1485d016b5f59c828df4232e3b7d946e554bb4432f5fd2fd153c286685363",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "35f1485d016b5f59c828df4232e3b7d946e554bb4432f5fd2fd153c286685363",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以你要正义出台，你就得排除一切，让它做第一个尖儿。",
      "output_sha256": "9415fe31c81e14c82e04140498ae65eb0f5aebd893f055ad21d4b5c6574fb1c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "9415fe31c81e14c82e04140498ae65eb0f5aebd893f055ad21d4b5c6574fb1c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你得凭着它自己的名字叫它出台。",
      "output_sha256": "4b71781227198c2dd6e7654f396875edd3166e7e27cb6e694f713272f0d43a97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "4b71781227198c2dd6e7654f396875edd3166e7e27cb6e694f713272f0d43a97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "你还得抖擞精神，准备一副好身手，因为它是初出台的角儿，捣乱的人必多，你得准备着打不打不成相识呀！",
      "output_sha256": "48bae0ba42d8e59a750542abc9bc07dc938d72840c7c3c16760a21de14a13b95",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_human_sha256": "48bae0ba42d8e59a750542abc9bc07dc938d72840c7c3c16760a21de14a13b95",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "打得站住了脚携住了手，那时我们就能从容的瞻仰正义的面目了。",
      "output_sha256": "4f0f7b95e780e5faaf0760f0f260282cd9eb82ad9375a7c74c6129f48850301c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
